#### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Register (CUSTOMER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Responsável Teste",
  "email": "teste@pw2m.com.br",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@pw2m.com.br",
  "password": "12345678"
}

@token = COLE_O_JWT_AQUI
@adminToken = COLE_O_JWT_ADMIN_AQUI

### Fabricar lote (ROLE_ADMIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/devices/manufacture
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "category": "CHAVEIRO"
}

### Ativar chaveiro (código + PIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceCode": "PW2M-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX",
  "activationCode": "123456"
}

### Meus dispositivos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar pessoa
POST http://localhost:8080/api/children
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "João Teste",
  "personType": "CHILD",
  "birthDate": "2019-06-24",
  "bloodType": "O+",
  "city": "Cosmópolis",
  "state": "SP",
  "publicEnabled": true,
  "medical": {
    "allergies": "Penicilina",
    "conditions": "",
    "medications": "",
    "healthPlan": "",
    "healthPlanNumber": "",
    "emergencyNotes": "Em caso de emergência, contatar os responsáveis."
  },
  "contacts": [
    {
      "name": "Responsável Teste",
      "relation": "Mãe",
      "phone": "19999999999",
      "whatsapp": "5519999999999",
      "priority": 1
    }
  ]
}

### Vincular dispositivo à pessoa
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "personId": 1,
  "deviceName": "Chaveiro da escola"
}

### Desvincular
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/devices/1/unassign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ficha pública pelo código da tag
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/devices/PW2M-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX
